{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Matchmaker Agency",
    "steam_appid": 2204260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204260/extras/69284ba561e83012462ef2a3338dd77c.avif?t=1747996541\" /></div><br><br>Have you ever had a failed date? Are you tired of having awkward moments with strangers you just met from an online application or friends? <strong>Now's your chance to change that.</strong> It's time for <strong>YOU</strong> to become cupid and match couples together in this <strong>immersed, compelling story-based game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204260/extras/0e67624878240426d155b97435f69ad7.avif?t=1747996541\" /></div><br><br>Starting as an amateur in the ways of romance, you will quickly learn what it takes to fulfill people's hopes and dreams. <i>Gain reputation points </i>and <i>cash</i> for matching couples successfully, <i>unlock upgrades</i> to enhance events, and <i>enjoy the lovely feline companion</i> <strong>Charles </strong>along the way. But don't forget -- <strong>it's a race against the clock</strong> and you owe the landlord money! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204260/extras/02d5b869df1253a844b51e34a1f6d47d.avif?t=1747996541\" /></div><br><br><strong>Become The Matchmaker</strong> - Analyze and interview clients, scout the perfect location, select the finest gifts and plan their dates. You might not be the best bachelor/bachelorette, but at least you can be the <i>best matchmaker in the game</i>!<br><br><strong>Clients </strong>- <i>Procedurally-generated clients</i> with a (nearly) endless combination of personality types, perk points, and personal tastes. Different kinds of people with different needs for love!<br><br><strong>Special Clients</strong> - Meet unique clients each with<i> intriguing backstories </i>and goals (with hot potential lovers). Will you assist them in obtaining their one true love? Or would it be more fun to purposefully sabotage the moment?<br><br><strong>Upgrades</strong> - Upgrades people, upgrades! <i>Earn rewards</i> with every successful match, which can be spent to upgrade your skills and improve your office. Unlocking more of your matchmaking capabilities!<br><br><strong>Chill and Relax</strong> - Play and enjoy the game at your own pace. After all, love takes time to bloom and shouldn't be rushed.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204260/extras/69284ba561e83012462ef2a3338dd77c.avif?t=1747996541\" /></div><br><br>Have you ever had a failed date? Are you tired of having awkward moments with strangers you just met from an online application or friends? <strong>Now's your chance to change that.</strong> It's time for <strong>YOU</strong> to become cupid and match couples together in this <strong>immersed, compelling story-based game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204260/extras/0e67624878240426d155b97435f69ad7.avif?t=1747996541\" /></div><br><br>Starting as an amateur in the ways of romance, you will quickly learn what it takes to fulfill people's hopes and dreams. <i>Gain reputation points </i>and <i>cash</i> for matching couples successfully, <i>unlock upgrades</i> to enhance events, and <i>enjoy the lovely feline companion</i> <strong>Charles </strong>along the way. But don't forget -- <strong>it's a race against the clock</strong> and you owe the landlord money! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204260/extras/02d5b869df1253a844b51e34a1f6d47d.avif?t=1747996541\" /></div><br><br><strong>Become The Matchmaker</strong> - Analyze and interview clients, scout the perfect location, select the finest gifts and plan their dates. You might not be the best bachelor/bachelorette, but at least you can be the <i>best matchmaker in the game</i>!<br><br><strong>Clients </strong>- <i>Procedurally-generated clients</i> with a (nearly) endless combination of personality types, perk points, and personal tastes. Different kinds of people with different needs for love!<br><br><strong>Special Clients</strong> - Meet unique clients each with<i> intriguing backstories </i>and goals (with hot potential lovers). Will you assist them in obtaining their one true love? Or would it be more fun to purposefully sabotage the moment?<br><br><strong>Upgrades</strong> - Upgrades people, upgrades! <i>Earn rewards</i> with every successful match, which can be spent to upgrade your skills and improve your office. Unlocking more of your matchmaking capabilities!<br><br><strong>Chill and Relax</strong> - Play and enjoy the game at your own pace. After all, love takes time to bloom and shouldn't be rushed.",
